    "preamble": "Rohit Bhai Kanada, Asst. Manager, ... vs State Of M.P. on 3 September, 2025 Author: Milind Ramesh Phadke Bench: Milind Ramesh Phadke Neutral Citation No. 2025:Mphc-Gwl:20366 1 In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At Gwalior Before Hon'Ble Shri Justice Milind Ramesh Phadke On The 3 rd Of September, 2025 Misc. Criminal Case No. 1635 of 2013 Rohit Bhai Kanada, Asst. Manager, Nominee Firm Ramdev Food Products Limited And Others Versus State Of M.P. Appearance: None for the applicants. Shri Samar Ghuraiya - Public Prosecutor for respondent/S Order",
    "facts": "The present petition under section 482 Cr.P.C. has been filed by the applicant for quashing the proceedings pending in the court of Judicial Magistrate First Class, Gwalior in Case No. 491/2005 which have been instituted in the year 1997 on the complaint filed by the respondent/complainant for the offence under section 7(1) and section 16(1)(A)(1) of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954. Since the present petition is of the year 2013, with the efflux of time, the same has lost its efficacy.",
